The current dispRatio value is 0.00

variable totLength equal 1121.3409
variable commDist equal "v_totLength*v_dispRatio"
variable dispDist equal "v_commDist/2"

variable seed equal 1
units real
boundary p p p

atom_style molecular

lattice sc 2500
Lattice spacing in x,y,z = 2500 2500 2500

region main block -1.5 2.5 -0.5 1.5 -1.5 2.5 units lattice
region insertionVolume block -1 2 0 1 -1 2 units lattice

create_box 84 main bond/types 83 angle/types 82 extra/bond/per/atom 2 extra/angle/per/atom 3 extra/special/per/atom 6
Created orthogonal box = (-3750 -1250 -3750) to (6250 3750 6250)
  4 by 2 by 4 MPI processor grid

molecule productionIdealized productionIdealized84.txt
Read molecule template productionIdealized:
# Molecule File for Linear Dimer of Idealized Chain of Alpha Spectrin
  1 molecules
  0 fragments
  84 atoms with max type 84
  83 bonds with max type 83
  82 angles with max type 82
  0 dihedrals with max type 0
  0 impropers with max type 0
bond_style harmonic
angle_style harmonic

# Uncomment below if using dispRatio 0.00 OR if NOT using INTEL package
#
 pair_style none

# Uncomment below if using INTEL package AND NOT using dispRatio 0.00
#
# pair_style lj/cut 0
# pair_coeff * * 0 0

create_atoms 0 single 0 0 0 mol productionIdealized ${seed} rotate 0 0 0 1
create_atoms 0 single 0 0 0 mol productionIdealized 1 rotate 0 0 0 1
Created 84 atoms
  using lattice units in orthogonal box = (-3750 -1250 -3750) to (6250 3750 6250)
  create_atoms CPU = 0.003 seconds

read_data IdealizedCoeffs84.data add merge
Reading data file ...
  orthogonal box = (-3750 -1250 -3750) to (6250 3750 6250)
  4 by 2 by 4 MPI processor grid
Finding 1-2 1-3 1-4 neighbors ...
  special bond factors lj:    0        0        0       
  special bond factors coul:  0        0        0       
     3 = max # of 1-2 neighbors
     6 = max # of 1-3 neighbors
    18 = max # of 1-4 neighbors
    13 = max # of special neighbors
  special bonds CPU = 0.002 seconds
  read_data CPU = 0.007 seconds


group firstAtoms type 1
1 atoms in group firstAtoms
group lastAtoms type 84
1 atoms in group lastAtoms
displace_atoms firstAtoms move 0  ${dispDist} 0  units box
displace_atoms firstAtoms move 0  0 0  units box
Displacing atoms ...
displace_atoms lastAtoms move  0 -${dispDist} 0  units box
displace_atoms lastAtoms move  0 -0 0  units box
Displacing atoms ...

group endpoints union firstAtoms lastAtoms
2 atoms in group endpoints

compute bondID all property/local btype batom1 batom2
compute angleID all property/local atype aatom1 aatom2 aatom3

fix restraint all arclengthrestraint productionIdealized 0.5 ${totLength}
fix restraint all arclengthrestraint productionIdealized 0.5 1121.3409

fix stationary endpoints setforce 0.0 0.0 0.0

comm_modify cutoff 100

minimize 0.0 1.0e-9 100000 100000

